<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<set xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:shareInterpolator="false">
    <!-- CLOSE-exit of the folder page (album grid -> home), both for the platform's
         custom cross-Activity back animation and for the plain toolbar/back-button
         finish().

         Same contract as oxygen_classic_page_back_exit.xml - no scale/rotation, both
         children on the full set duration, same 96dp +X retarget - but on the
         folder-only clock and with folder-only curves. The folder page is the one place
         where the foreground is the only moving element: on the custom branch the
         entering parent keeps a full-screen base rect with alpha pinned to 1, so it is
         already fully composed underneath before this animation starts.

         Why this pair was retimed in phase 2
         ===================================
         Phase 1 tied the fade to the travel on a 300 ms clock (alpha 1 -> 0 across the
         whole resource). The device report kept the "两个网格叠加溶解" reading: at 40%
         of the clock the foreground was still 0.559 opaque while two dense grids were
         both fully drawn, and at 50% it was 0.375 - a long semi-transparent overlap
         carried by the slowest part of the clock.
         Phase 2 shortens the clock to 220 ms and finishes the dissolve at 82% of it,
         where the slide already carries 94% of its travel. The last visible frame is
         still a moving frame (no "evaporate in place", no hard cut at removal), but the
         mid-opacity band is both shorter in time and lower in opacity.

         Measured through AnimationSet#getTransformationAt (the Shell's own path):
             progress   alpha   travel (x96dp)
             0.02       0.995   0.014
             0.10       0.945   0.094
             0.20       0.820   0.238
             0.30       0.634   0.403
             0.40       0.394   0.561
             0.50       0.238   0.700
             0.60       0.132   0.785
             0.80       0.005   0.920
             0.82       0.000   0.938
         Compare phase 1 at the same normalised progress (0.40 -> 0.559, 0.50 -> 0.375,
         1.00 -> 0.000) on a clock 36% longer.

         The settings, theme and custom-photo-profile pages keep the shared
         oxygen_classic_page_back_* pair: retiming this file must not retime them. -->
    <alpha
        android:fromAlpha="1.0"
        android:toAlpha="0.0"
        android:interpolator="@interpolator/oxygen_classic_folder_back_alpha"
        android:startOffset="0"
        android:duration="@integer/oxygen_classic_folder_back_duration_ms" />

    <translate
        android:fromXDelta="0"
        android:toXDelta="@dimen/oxygen_classic_page_back_slide_distance"
        android:interpolator="@interpolator/oxygen_classic_folder_back_slide"
        android:startOffset="0"
        android:duration="@integer/oxygen_classic_folder_back_duration_ms" />
</set>
